  "description": "WebTorrent model delivery for SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML. Supplies HubModelStream, an IModelSource that streams models from the SpawnDev hub as lazy-hash torrents - seekable, cached to OPFS by piece, resumed across reloads and seeded to peers. Optional: SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML delivers models over plain HTTP by default and does not depend on WebTorrent.",
