  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1 - Pins SpawnDev.WebTorrent 4.2.8. 1.0.0 pinned 4.2.7, which is binary-broken against SpawnDev.SpawnJS 2.1.17: 4.2.7 was compiled against SpawnJS 2.1.7, where FileSystemWritableFileStream.Seek and .Truncate took a ulong, and 2.1.17 takes a long. The change is source-compatible, so nothing in a build, restore or publish reports it, but the shipped IL still calls the ulong overloads and NuGet loads 2.1.17 beside them - MissingMethodException at runtime on the createWritable piece-write path. Nothing in THIS package changed; it carried the break transitively, which is the whole reason the pin has to move. Consumers on 1.0.0 should upgrade.",
